 61MN c  Measurement of spin and static magnetic dipole moment of the g.s.      
 61MN c  {+61}Mn beam produced in U(p,X) reaction at E(p)=1.4 GeV at CERN-ISOLDE
 61MN2c  facility using a RILIS source. Measured hyperfine structure using      
 61MN3c  collinear laser spectroscopy (COLLAPS) technique. Deduced hyperfine    
 61MN4c  constants for {+6}P{-3/2} excited state, spin and magnetic dipole      
 61MN5c  moment of ground state of {+61}Mn. The magnetic dipole moment          
 61MN6c  of {+55}Mn, |m=+3.46871790 {I9} was used as a standard reference for   
 61MN7c  other Mn isotopes. Comparison with shell-model calculations using      
 61MN8c  GXPF1A interaction                                                     
 61MN cL J$Spin from analysis of hyperfine structure spectrum in the present    
